OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FOvercast but
OL,6,Fdry through the evening. Rain, mostly
OL,7,Flight but with the odd heavy burst,
OL,8,Farrives by midnight with winds
OL,9,Fstrengthening and become blustery in
OL,10,Fplaces. Temperatures around average.
OL,11,
OL,12,CFriday:FA cloudy start with rain
OL,13,Fthrough the day, turning heavy at
OL,14,Ftimes. The rain slowly clears by late
OL,15,Fafternoon. Breezy.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
