OL,5,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FWindy
OL,6,FSaturday, with sunny spells and
OL,7,Fisolated showers. Dry, with cloudy
OL,8,Fperiods and sunny spells on Sunday,
OL,9,Fwind easing. Becoming cloudy with
OL,10,Flight rain Monday afternoon, breezy at
OL,11,Ftimes.
